== Create ==
*Click on '''Create Instance''' on the Article card
*A '''title''' for the entry is required
*A '''description''' is '''optional''' but '''recommended''' as the entry can also be found via it
*The title and description can be given in '''German''' and '''English'''
*Additional '''properties''' can be '''added''' as required by clicking on them in the Select properties drop-down menu
*'''Saving''' automatically redirects to the created entry
