== Attachment ==
*On the bottom of the page you can '''upload files''' via '''drag-and-drop''' or '''upload button'''
*An '''attached file''' can also be '''integrated''' into the page, as can be seen under Visual Edit Article
*{{Template:Decoration/ColoredText|text=If the attachment is an image under CC license please name the source e.g. in the description|red=1|blue=0|green=0|black=0}}
