== Edit Article ==
*Click on '''Edit data''' on the article page
*The '''properties''' of the article can be '''edited''' in the data editor e.g.
** Add a description afterwards
**Add an image to the entry that is also displayed in the search suggestion list (shown in gif)
**...
*Click on '''Save'''
