== Visual Edit Article ==
*Click on '''Edit data''' on the article page
*There are various options to '''format''' your '''text'''
{{Template:Viewer/Media
| image_size = 600
| mode = default
| textdata = File:OSW88f0f3a3a14d4c898839c5f2796dc642.gif{{!}};
}}
*Various elements such as '''lists''', '''tables''' or '''media''' etc. can also be integrated into the article
*Add media
**'''Search''' for e.g. an image in the '''attachments''' or '''anywhere''' in ArkEve '''or'''
**'''upload''' an image from you computer by clicking on the blue '''plus button'''
***This opens a '''separate''' editor in which the image can be uploaded
**{{Template:Decoration/ColoredText|text=If it is an image under CC license please name the source e.g. in the description|red=1|blue=0|green=0|black=0}}
*'''Save''' the changes
*For further information please have a look at the {{Template:Viewer/Link|page=|url=https://www.mediawiki.org/wiki/Help:VisualEditor/User_guide|label=General Userguide}}
