| image_size = 600
| mode = default
| textdata = File:OSW43a9a2c9afff4830a032ec5f79a6cf77.gif{{!}};
}}

== Special Editors ==
*In the '''visual edit mode (Edit button)''' elements such as '''diagrams''', '''spreadsheets''', '''chemical reactions''' and more can be inserted
*Add DrawIo (shown in gif)
**Click on Insert -> Template
**To '''search''' for the desired template, start with '''Editor/'''
** A '''title''' is required
**After saving, a '''placeholder''' appears in which you have to '''click''' on '''edit'''
** Click on '''Save in DrawIo''' before leaving the page
